[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_2ad3p")
id = "1.4.3"
title = "Minimum Contrast"
short_description = "This criterion requires text to have sufficient contrast against its background, with a minimum ratio of 4.5:1 for normal text."
long_description = "[b][u]OBJECTIVE[/u][/b]
The WCAG 2.1 success criterion 1.4.3 - Contrast (Minimum) ensures that text remains readable for users with visual impairments or reduced contrast sensitivity. Low contrast can make content difficult to perceive regardless of color differences.

[b][u]TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS[/u][/b]
[indent]
[b]•[/b] [b]Normal Text:[/b] Requires a contrast ratio of at least 4.5:1.
[b]•[/b] [b]Large/Bold Text:[/b] Requires a contrast ratio of at least 3:1.
[b]•[/b] [b]Scope:[/b] The rule also applies to images of text and text shown during interactions such as hover or focus states.
[b]•[/b] [b]Exemptions:[/b] Decorative text, inactive elements, and logos are exempt.
[/indent]
[b][u]TIP[/u][/b]
Use the color picker to change the color of the text in foreground. Ensure that the numeric contrast ratio meets the 4.5:1 requirement for clear readability."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://mgn4yar0d3vn"
